  "description": "Charlotte de Witte’s career has gone from strength to strength this year. She dropped the ‘Amor’ EP and ‘A Prayer For The Dancefloor’ / ‘Malina’ single via her own KNTXT label, and her new live audiovisual project, The Resistance, kicked off over summer at Ibiza’s [UNVRS]. An “XXL” version of that show dazzled more than 40,000 people at Belgium’s Rock Werchter festival. The project has also been released as an EP of the same name, featuring Theo Nasa and XSALT, with all proceeds donated to the global non-profit, Nighttime Foundation.",
